 "remarks": "Completely reimagined and expanded to nearly twice its original footprint, this exceptional Riverside residence is the result of a meticulous gut renovation by Abode Interiors NYC, where sophisticated design meets effortless modern living. Graceful arches, soaring 9- and 10-foot cathedral ceilings, wide-plank Brazilian oak floors and a marble fireplace establish a refined architectural language, while all-new windows bathe the interiors in natural light. At the heart of the home, an Architectural Digest-worthy custom kitchen pairs Calacatta Gold marble, quartz countertops, Bosch appliances and bespoke millwork with an expansive eat-in peninsula. The adjoining dining area opens through dramatic 12-foot sliding doors to an oversized deck, creating a seamless connection between indoor and outdoor entertaining. A light-filled, lofted family room offers a striking second living space, while the privately positioned primary suite is a serene retreat with a custom-designed dressing room and spa-inspired bath featuring a freestanding soaking tub, oversized shower and double vanity. Five bedrooms thoughtfully arranged across separate levels provide exceptional privacy and flexibility.",
